nvim
====

The leader is Space. jj escapes in insert mode and on the command line.

FILES AND SEARCH (FZF.VIM)
  <leader>o                 Files (<leader>O fullscreen)
  <leader>b                 Buffers (jumps to an open window)
  <leader>rg                Rg (ripgrep)
  <leader>gls               GFiles (git ls-files)
  <leader>gs                GFiles? (git status)
  <leader>l                 BLines (lines in this buffer)
  <leader>;                 Commands
  <leader>                  Marks
  <leader>t                 Tags
  <leader>T                 BTags (visual mode: selected text)
  <leader><tab>             Search mappings
  ctrl-p                    On the : command line, command history
  F1                        Helptags

INSERT MODE COMPLETION
  ctrl-x ctrl-f             Complete a path
  ctrl-x ctrl-l             Complete a line
  ctrl-x ctrl-k             Complete a word (only if /usr/share/dict/words exists)

BUFFERS, WINDOWS AND FILES
  <leader>j / <leader>k     Previous / next buffer
  <leader>x                 Close the buffer, keep the window
  ctrl-h/j/k/l              Move to the window left/down/up/right
  <leader>nt                Toggle NERDTree (I toggles hidden files)
  <leader>w / <leader>wa    :w / :wa
  <leader>W                 Save with sudo
  <leader>q / <leader>Q / <leader>qa
                            :q / :q! / :qa

EDITING
  H / L                     Start / end of the line
  Y                         Yank to the end of the line
  Enter                     Break the line (normal mode)
  ctrl-e                    End of the line (insert mode)
  =                         Toggle comment (nerdcommenter)
  <leader>rw                Replace the word under the cursor everywhere (visual mode: the
                            selection)
  <leader>/                 Search for the visual selection
  <leader>hw / <leader>hW   Highlight the word under the cursor on / off
  <leader>noh               Clear the search highlight
  <leader>.                 Play macro q (record with qq)

GIT
  ]c / [c                   Next / previous hunk (gitgutter default)
  <leader>hp / <leader>hs / <leader>hu
                            Preview / stage / undo the hunk (gitgutter default)
  :Git / :G                 fugitive (no custom maps)
  <leader>d                 Toggle diff for this window

TOGGLES AND MISC
  F4                        Line numbers
  F5                        gitgutter
  F6                        Strip whitespace on save
  F7                        Paste mode
  <leader>cd                lcd to the directory of the file
  <leader>ev                Edit the vimrc
  <leader>md                Toggle the Markdown preview (Markdown files)
